return {h=7,w=160,cr=120,hc=15,bh=70,gr="medium-slow",eg={"flying"},st={62,73,55,56,52,84},ab={{49,0},{177,1}},genus={en="Ember Pokémon",es="Pokémon Lumbre",pt="Pokémon Brasa"},flavor={en={[23]="From its beak, it expels embers that set the tall grass on fire. Then it pounces on the bewildered prey that pop out of the grass.",[24]="The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going.",[25]="From its beak, it expels embers that set the tall grass on fire. Then it pounces on the bewildered prey that pop out of the grass.",[26]="The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going.",[27]="From its beak, it fires embers at its prey. Once it has caught them, it grills them at high heat before feasting upon them.",[28]="It will not tolerate other Fletchinder entering its territory, which has a radius of several miles.",[29]="It scatters embers in the tall grass. Then bug Pokémon, frightened by the flames, come flying out, and Fletchinder gobbles them up.",[30]="Its speed right after takeoff already puts it in the top speed class of all bird Pokémon.",[33]="Fletchinder launches embers into the den of its prey. When the prey comes leaping out, Fletchinder’s sharp talons finish it off.",[34]="Fletchinder are exceedingly territorial and aggressive. These Pokémon fight among themselves over feeding grounds."},es={[23]="Lanza chispas por su pico y prende fuego a la hierba alta para así sorprender a sus presas y atraparlas cuando intentan escapar.",[24]="Cuanto más intenso sea el calor que se genera en la saca de fuego de su vientre, más rápido es capaz de volar. Sin embargo, la llama tarda en prender.",[25]="Lanza chispas por su pico y prende fuego a la hierba alta para así sorprender a sus presas y atraparlas cuando intentan escapar.",[26]="Cuanto más intenso sea el calor que se genera en la saca de fuego de su vientre, más rápido es capaz de volar. Sin embargo, la llama